<title>POLAND: POLISH YR/YR PPI 9.8 PCT IN APRIL VS 10.4 MARCH.</title>
<headline>POLISH YR/YR PPI 9.8 PCT IN APRIL VS 10.4 MARCH.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish producer prices rose 0.6</p>
<p>percent in April against a 0.6 percent rise in March, taking</p>
<p>year-on-year producer price inflation down to 9.8 percent, the</p>
<p>Central Statistical Office (GUS) said.</p>
<p>It said PPI rose 3.7 percent in the January-April period.</p>
</text>
